# Secrets are managed by Infisical Cloud (https://app.infisical.com).
# The Infisical CLI exports them at container startup via universal auth.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create a project on https://app.infisical.com
#   2. Set the workspaceId in .infisical.json
#   3. Add environments: dev, prod
#   4. Add secrets for each env (POSTGRES_PASSWORD, DATABASE_URL,
#      AUTH_SECRET, AUTH_URL, AUTH_TRUST_HOST, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD)
#   5. Create a machine identity with Universal Auth for each environment
#   6. Set these host env vars before running docker compose:
#      export INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID="<identity-client-id>"
#      export INFISICAL_CLIENT_SECRET="<identity-client-secret>"
#      # INFISICAL_ENV defaults to "dev" if not set
#      # POSTGRES_PASSWORD defaults to "trades_dev_password" if not set
#
# For local dev without Docker:
#   infisical run --env=dev -- npm run dev:next
#   infisical run --env=dev -- npm run db:seed
#
# See: https://infisical.com/docs/integrations/frameworks/nextjs
